```

Mở port nếu chưa có:

```bash
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=8035/tcp
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=8036/tcp
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=8037/tcp
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=8038/tcp
